OL,3,GNEWSAMurder-accused stepdad declines to
OL,4,Agive evidence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article contains distressing
OL,7,Fdetails
OL,9,FA man accused of murdering his
OL,10,Fstepdaughter at her university flat has
OL,11,Fdeclined to give evidence at his trial.
OL,13,FNathan Owens, 34 and from Hartlepool,
OL,14,Fis accused of killing Carla Georgescu
OL,15,Fin the 19-year-old's room at her hall
OL,16,Fof residence in Preston in February.
OL,18,FProsecutors closed their case at
OL,19,FPreston Crown Court on Monday, but
OL,20,FOwens, who denies murder, said he would
OL,21,Fnot be taking to the witness box or
OL,22,Foffer any other testimony.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
